    "notes": "Schedule #9 (Preparation Pay for Free Television Pictures, Limited Series Productions (Mini-Series) and Theatrical Motion Pictures, pages 42-43) also applies to Theatrical Motion Pictures at full/undiscounted rates and includes a dedicated Theatrical Motion Pictures pay table on page 43, but it was excluded from studio_schedule/distant_schedule selections since it is a Preparation Pay schedule rather than the primary Studio Minimum or Distant Location wage schedule. If Preparation Pay schedules are also desired, Schedule #9 (pages 42-43) is the correct full-rate theatrical preparation pay schedule (with #10 and #11 being its 3%-reduced and one-year-lag counterparts, respectively, and thus excluded)."
